WEBVTT

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:03.000
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Cafeteria

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.520
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Cafeteria
December 28th 07:32

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.150
Asuka Tennoji

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.440
H-Hi, Aina...

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.200
Aina Mikage

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.410
Aina!

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:23.450
What, are you having a 
fight with your girlfriend?

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:23.640
Cafeteria Lady
Mrs. Wakamoto

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.030
Oh, no...

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:28.040
Give me an extra large again today.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.100
Asuka!

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:08.870
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.250
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms
December 28th 08:01

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:10.100
Asuka!

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:15.130
The Proud  Fierte

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:12.920
Asuka...

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.730
Are you thinking about Aina?

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.240
I wonder if we'll ever be friends again...

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:23.870
It's not like you to lose heart like that!

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.370
Fierte...

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:28.950
One of your best qualities

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:31.880
is your meddling that 
falls just short of obnoxious.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.000
When you captured me so we could escape,

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.070
when you ran off carrying Azumi,

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.060
and when you fought to save Ayase,

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.640
you were meddling.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.550
Don't praise me so much...

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:46.390
Wait, that was an insult.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:54.900
But your meddling has saved us all.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:03:02.410
So Asuka, I believe that if anyone 
can fix things with Aina, it's you.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.850
Thanks, Fierte.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:09.980
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Cafeteria

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:13.060
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Cafeteria
December 29th 08:32

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:16.440
Aina.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.550
Listen to me, Aina.

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.150
I really understand how you feel.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.590
But just like there are many 
different kinds of people,

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:34.450
I think there are many 
different kinds of Z/X.

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:38.200
Fierte and the others aren't bad people.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.570
It was fun when we were all 
hanging out together, wasn't it?

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.840
It might not happen right away,

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:51.160
but I think you can be friends with them again.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.890
I'll be waiting, okay?

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:04.180
I'll be waiting until I can 
be friends with you again.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.200
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Aina's Room

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:08.180
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Aina's Room
December 29th 08:45

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:11.070
I want to be friends with you too, Tennoji.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.410
And with Ayase.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.110
Why do you all have to have Z/X with you?

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.660
Because they have Z/X...

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:29.370
I...

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:32.060
I...

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:36.170
I see.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.790
Well, there's no point in rushing things.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:42.000
I just told her I'd be waiting.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:47.320
Yes, let's wait until Aina opens her heart.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:52.810
Fierte!

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.820
What are you doing to Fierte?

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:34.620
<i>Are you Kozukenosuke Kira?</i>

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.620
<i>Indeed.</i>

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.100
What was that?

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:41.250
Everybody's making such a big 
deal out of the new year.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:42.340
December 29th 16:33 Kobe East Shopping District

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.110
The year is just changing, right?

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.620
Azumi Kagamihara

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.120
Sword Sniper  Rigel

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.320
What is it, Azumi?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.340
Where are you going to put that?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.080
You can't put it at the entrance 
to our hotel room, can you?

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.130
I'll think of something.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:10.070
What's the point of that wreath?

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:11.620
December 29th 16:55 Kobe City Alleys

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:12.230
The fern leaves are for long life.

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:15.770
The orange and the false daphne 
leaves are for a happy family.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.360
Are you saying the wreath 
is made with some sort of

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.900
high-level system capable 
of achieving these things?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.300
December 29th 21:33 Kitano, Kobe

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:49.800
To: Aina Mikage
Subject: To Aina
I understand how you feel, 
but I think of you as a friend.
 I'm here if you need me.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.550
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.410
What are you moping about?

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.290
The Black Blade  Sieger

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.930
I'm not moping.

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.950
Not that it matters to me.

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.690
Why don't you go take a 
bath and clear your head?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.380
Yeah, I think I will.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.100
Enjoy yourself.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:10.700
Sieger.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:11.720
Huh?

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:13.450
You're going to peek, right?

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.450
I'm not.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.070
Kidding, kidding.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.970
Of course I'm going to peek.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.890
It's party time.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:49.350
Here I come, Ayase!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.780
Wait, I'm not peeking yet!

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.280
Ayase!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.790
You...

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.420
You're a Black World Z/X!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.620
You're Audium, aren't you?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.650
Out of the way!

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:15.970
Sieger!

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:18.940
Sieger!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.480
Sieger! What's happening?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:32.240
She's sucking my resources out of me!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:32.990
What?

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:37.600
You bitch.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:41.500
You'd better quit pushing your luck!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.400
Sheesh.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:56.220
That one's gonna be a real pain.

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:57.790
Sieger!

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:01.550
Wake up, Sieger!

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:02.890
Sieger!

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:04.890
Sieger?

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.310
This can't be...

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:12.430
This beats peeking any day.

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:25.260
Hey, that Z/X...

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.560
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Asuka's Room

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:27.600
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Asuka's Room
December 29th 22:38

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.640
What was it?

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:27.860
I don't know.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:31.160
But we should be careful.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.550
Come with me for a bit.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:42.520
December 29th 23:17 Building Under Construction

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:45.160
What? Everybody else was also 
attacked by a long-haired Z/X?

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:45.960
Yes.

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.270
Her name is Audium.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.320
Audium?

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.590
That incredible aura of hate...

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:56.070
I'm sure of it.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:59.820
It's a nasty Z/X called the Hate Fiend.

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.330
It's not that strong,

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:07.330
but the problem is that it sucks 
resources out of other Z/X.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.920
What is she after?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.570
We don't know. That's why 
we brought you all here.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:16.760
Do you have any ideas?

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.090
Well?

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:21.600
No.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:23.820
Nothing for us, huh?

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:26.850
It's likely it'll attack again.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.870
We'll need to be ready.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.290
That's right.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:35.110
Starting tomorrow, I'll need to stay 
with you in the restroom, in the bath—

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.360
I guess I don't need to worry about you.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.620
Give me your number.

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:48.440
Make it quick.

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.500
I'm tired of coming to get you every time.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.500
Yeah, good point.

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:58.900
Okay, let's go, Ayase.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:10:59.470
Yeah.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.070
Hey, what about your number?

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.760
You don't need it, do you?

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:08.500
If anything happens, I'll contact you.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:14.280
Huh?

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:16.210
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Aina's Room

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.670
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Aina's Room
December 30th 06:50

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:29.160
I feel great.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:43.450
December 30th 11:28 Kobe City Suburbs

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.090
Are you sure you want to come, too?

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.050
Of course.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:47.800
We don't know when or 
where Audium will attack.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.070
That's right.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:52.350
Tennoji! I've been waiting for you.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.610
Aina!

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:58.630
I've sorted out my feelings.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.760
Good morning, Aina!

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:01.650
Aina...

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:04.060
Take me somewhere fun, Tennoji!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:10.370
S-Sorry... I mean... I'm on my way 
to visit my mom in the hospital.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:13.370
I'll go with you.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:14.750
Huh?!

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:17.500
December 30th 14:02 Kiyozono Hospital

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:19.500
Oh, oh... my, my!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.500
Asuka's Mother

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.820
You've got two cute girls with you.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.280
There's more to you than I thought, Asuka.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.300
They're just friends.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.640
I bet he drives you up the wall, huh?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:34.660
He'd be kind of cute if 
he'd keep his mouth shut.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.320
It's a shame, really.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.400
That's not true.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.400
Tennoji is really nice and dependable!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.630
Aww, you're flattering him.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.150
It's true!

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:49.560
When I'd just come to Kobe,

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:53.410
I got lost on the way to the dorms.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.590
<i>Oww...</i>

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:57.760
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:00.270
<i>Are you hurt?</i>

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:10.730
He took my luggage and 
showed me to the dorm.

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:13.480
I was so lonely since it was 
my first time in this town.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.310
Er... I did that?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.260
That's awful.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:21.730
You don't remember, Asuka?

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.710
No, I... Sorry.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:25.810
Asuka.

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.950
Want to go get some drinks?

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:34.390
So, which one are you after?

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:36.310
December 30th 15:15
Kiyozono Hospital Break Room

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.920
I told you, they're just friends!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.160
I'm just kidding.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.590
I think you're a good, kind boy.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.960
What's this about?

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:49.320
But that kindness can hurt people, too.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:56.230
Aina, was it?

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.230
Look out for her, would you?

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.460
Thank you for today.

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:08.820
It was fun!

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:09.550
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Front Entrance

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.640
I had fun, too.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:12.510
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Front Entrance
December 30th 16:33

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:13.610
See you tomorrow at Broccolo.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:14.460
Yeah.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:16.220
Bye!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.000
Oh, right.

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:22.500
Throw away your Card Device.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.130
I told you, I've sorted out my feelings.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.640
We just need to get rid of the Z/X!

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:31.890
Right?

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.890
Aina?

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.550
Bye!

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:41.290
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Asuka's Room

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.900
Asuka, thank you for everything 
you've done for me.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.900
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Asuka's Room
December 30th 19:21

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:46.730
Fierte, what are you...

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:50.530
I'm going back to the White World.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:51.910
Why?

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.780
You said you left 'cause you hated it.

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:57.540
I don't want to cause any 
more problems for you.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.040
You can stay here like you always have.

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:02.730
But...

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:05.530
I can't kick somebody out 
if they need my help.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:07.300
Or I wouldn't be Asuka Tennoji.

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:09.800
Asuka...

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:13.250
Aina will understand someday.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:17.430
Somebody once said my meddling 
helps everyone, too.

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:20.900
Even if it does fall just short of obnoxious.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:24.560
Thank you, Asuka.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:28.920
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Aina's Room

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.060
I feel great again today.

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.670
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Aina's Room
December 31st 06:59

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.280
December 31st 08:32 Kobe Fountain Park

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.540
I'm sorry about earlier.
I've sorted out my feelings.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.410
I'm so glad.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.040
Get rid of your card device, okay?

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:49.050
Get rid of your card device, okay?

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:47.430
Aina?

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:52.650
December 31st 19:02 Mountaintop Hotel

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:55.740
That's where you want it?

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:56.750
Yes.

00:15:57.190 --> 00:16:00.310
Well, if that's where you want it...

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:05.440
What's wrong?

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.690
I sense a Z/X.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:12.550
December 31st 19:03 Kitano, Kobe

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.880
Is it Audium?

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:13.660
No, doesn't look like it.

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:17.910
It's still pretty bad, though.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.660
December 31st 19:50 Cafe Broccolo

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:28.660
<i>Next message: December 31st, 19:11.</i>

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.960
<i>We're sensing unknown Z/X 
to the west and north.</i>

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:35.180
<i>We're going to check it out.</i>

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.450
<i>Azumi and Rigel went to the north.</i>

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:39.180
<i>We're heading to the west.</i>

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:42.150
<i>Pick one of us and come help.</i>

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.760
<i>Asuka...</i>

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:54.050
Cafe Broccolo Owner 
Mr. Maru

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.550
I'm sorry, Asuka.

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:56.080
The place is getting crowded.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.200
Oh, right.

00:16:57.390 --> 00:17:01.060
December 31st 19:59 Kobe Northern Mountains

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.700
What are you doing?

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:04.800
What about you?

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:07.360
Why are you heading toward the town?

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:10.050
Sera Kurashiki

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.050
Well...

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:16.900
Mikado told me not to talk to strange Z/X.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:16.820
Ultimate Dinosaur  Orichalcum Tyranno

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:21.560
December 31st 20:34 Cafe Broccolo

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.730
Excuse me!

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:23.810
I'll be right there!

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.440
Not bad, upstart samurai.

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:31.490
My name is Rindo.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:33.710
Katana Samurai  Rindo

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.340
And I am no mere upstart!

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:37.230
That pea shooter won't hurt us!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.240
Azumi, can you hear me?

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:53.710
Yes.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:58.210
And where is that idiot 
when we need him?

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:00.660
Welcome.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.770
<i>Are you listening, Asuka?</i>

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:06.470
I can hear you fine.

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:07.690
<i>Then...</i>

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:10.770
I can't do anything about it. I'm at work.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.650
<i>Which is more important? 
Your job or Kobe?</i>

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.440
Both of them!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.050
Mikado Kurosaki

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.180
December 31st 20:45 Kobe Coast

